  // 1. Acceptance
  s1_h: '1. Acceptance of Terms',
  s1: 'These Terms apply to all use of the TariffStack website, calculator, classifier and any related pages. By loading any TariffStack page, by running a calculation, by querying the HS-code classifier, or by accepting the cookie notice, you confirm that you have read, understood and agreed to these Terms and to the Disclaimer (section 13 below). If you are accepting on behalf of an organization, you represent that you have authority to bind that organization.',

  // 2. Service description
  s2_h: '2. Service Description',
  s2: 'TariffStack is a browser-based estimator. The U.S. destination uses the full official stacked tariff (USITC HTS, subheading-level: base MFN + Section 301 + forced-labour duty + MPF/HMF) with origin-aware FTA preferences to produce landed-cost figures for a given HS code, origin, destination and declared value. The China destination uses the OFFICIAL 2026 China Customs import tariff schedule (State Council Tariff Commission, effective 2026-01-01), parsed from the published government schedule, and returns REAL rates (最惠国/MFN + 暂定/provisional where lower) where the HS code is matched — no fabricated figures. The tool is free to use, requires no account, and does not transmit your calculation inputs to our servers — calculations run entirely client-side once the dataset is loaded.',

  // 3. NOT legal/tax/broker advice
  s3_h: '3. Not Legal, Tax or Customs-Broker Advice',
  s3: 'TariffStack is an independent estimation tool. It is NOT a law firm, tax advisory firm, customs brokerage, licensed customs broker service, freight forwarder, trade-compliance consultancy, or accounting practice. Nothing on this site constitutes legal advice, tax advice, an opinion of counsel, a binding or advisory ruling from any customs authority, a classification ruling, or a formal compliance opinion for any jurisdiction. If you require such advice, you must engage a licensed attorney, customs broker or qualified professional in the relevant jurisdiction.',

  // 4. No Warranty
