  // 6. User responsibility
  s6_h: '6. Your Responsibility to Verify',
  s6: 'You are solely responsible for verifying the accuracy, completeness and applicability of any TariffStack output before relying on it. ALWAYS confirm the duty, tax, fee, classification, exemption, threshold, FTA preference and origin qualification with the relevant customs authority of the destination country, and where appropriate with a licensed customs broker in that jurisdiction, and consult qualified legal counsel before filing any entry, return, refund claim, exemption claim, AD-CVD response, Section 301 / 232 response, or any other compliance action.',

  // 7. Advertising — kept SHORT here; full detail lives on the Advertising & Privacy page
