  s8: 'The TariffStack source code, UI design, classifier logic, and the compiled dataset (the arrangement and selection of fields) are released under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (AGPL-3.0). You may view, fork and self-host the code under the terms of that license. The underlying source data remain the property of their respective authorities — USITC Harmonized Tariff Schedule, Federal Register, USTR, CBP, U.S. Census Bureau, UN Comtrade (used for the export-country trade-linkage data), and China Customs (official 2026 tariff schedule, integration in progress) — and are used in accordance with their respective open-data terms. TariffStack, the wordmark and the logo are trademarks of the operator.',

