  // 12. Changes & contact
  s12_h: '12. Changes to Terms & Contact',
  s12: 'We may revise these Terms to reflect changes in the law, in our data sources, in our advertising practices, or in our operations. The "Last updated" date above records the latest revision. Material changes will be announced by a banner on the home page for at least fourteen (14) days before they take effect. Continued use after a change takes effect constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms. Questions about these Terms may be sent to TariffStack@outlook.com, or to the team lead at zmarkz123zxc@gmail.com.',

  // 13. Disclaimer (consolidated plain-language statement)
