  s13: 'TariffStack is an independent estimation tool. The duties, taxes, and total landed costs shown are ESTIMATES under best-effort assumptions — NOT legal advice, tax advice, a customs-broker service, or licensed compliance advice for any jurisdiction. We make NO WARRANTY of accuracy, completeness, or currency of any rate, rule, exemption, threshold, or fee shown. We accept NO LIABILITY for any customs penalty, additional duty, tax, fine, late fee, demurrage, storage charge, seized goods, lost shipment, or any direct or consequential loss arising from how you use — or fail to verify — these estimates. U.S. rates reflect USITC HTS Rev {rev} ({date}) plus the official China Tariffs mapping and the 2026-07-24 forced-labor duty (9903.05.31, +12.5%); other markets use each destination\'s own official HS tariff schedule plus your selected origin\'s FTA preference. Exclusions, Section 232 (steel/alum 50%, autos 25%, pharma 100% eff. 2026-09-29), AD/CVD, FTA origin-qualification rules, de minimis thresholds, and destination VAT/GST/sales/consumption taxes may change your actual entry. ALWAYS confirm with the relevant customs authority or a licensed customs broker in the destination country — and consult qualified legal counsel when needed — before filing any entry, return, or refund claim.',

  back: '← Back to TariffStack',
};

